1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:01,158
Why do your glasses fog

2
00:00:01,158 --> 00:00:02,189
going out in summer?!

3
00:00:02,369 --> 00:00:04,659
Professor Poppleton here! Let's POP the mystery!

4
00:00:04,839 --> 00:00:08,377
Step from a 72°F air-conditioned room

5
00:00:08,377 --> 00:00:11,246
into 90°F air at 70% humidity.

6
00:00:11,526 --> 00:00:14,416
Guess! That muggy air's fog line

7
00:00:14,416 --> 00:00:16,674
is about 60, 79, or 90°F?

8
00:00:19,224 --> 00:00:21,536
About 79°F, by our maths!

9
00:00:21,816 --> 00:00:23,660
Click on subscribe, so your brain

10
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,890
can be as big as mine!

11
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:26,880
Your lens is under that fog line.

12
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,965
So summer fogs your glasses going out!

